# Name: Fancy Triangle
# Summary: Four-state triangular weave.
# Angle: 30
# Iterations: 7

axiom W;

match W then Left Left Left X Right Right Draw Right Right Z Draw X Left;
match X then Right Right Right W Left Left Draw Left Left Y Draw W Right;
match Y then Left Z Draw X Right Right Draw Right Right Z Left Left Left;
match Z then Right Y Draw W Left Left Draw Left Left Y Right Right Right;
